This document is distinguished from p_a3f1 (which puts these objects OUT_OF_HOUSE on weekdays) by asserting the *weekend* complement: the same objects are IN the house. It is distinguished from p_c3d8 (Minimal Travel) by allowing a brief midday errand window in which a handful of objects leave.

